Package: fcopy
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DMG Workshop <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/DMG-Workshop/FCOPY
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, ca-certificates, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libegl1, libgl1, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Verified file copying with a desktop queue and CLI
 Copy files locally or between paired PCs with checksums, pause/resume,
 bandwidth limits, transfer history and explicit recovery of unfinished jobs.
